flowchart TB
  Event[Compatible SecurityEvent] --> Rule[Active validated DetectionRule]
  Rule --> Evaluate[Deterministic evaluation]
  Evaluate --> Log[RuleEvaluationLog]
  Evaluate --> NoMatch[No-match / safe outcome]
  Evaluate --> Match[Matched result]
  Match --> Dedup[Deduplicate / correlate]
  Dedup --> Alert[Create or reuse SecurityAlert]
  Alert --> Evidence[Bounded SecurityAlertEvidence]
  Evidence --> Review[Authorized alert review]
